@startuml pool-provide-liquidity
skinparamlocked dpiCommandLine 200
title Provide liquidity

<style>
activityDiagram {
  FontName Inter
  FontSize 13
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  activity {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #64748B
    LineThickness 1
    RoundCorner 6
    FontColor #0F172A
    Padding 8
    Margin 7
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #64748B
    LineThickness 1.2
    FontColor #4A5A6A
    FontSize 11
  }
  swimlane {
    LineColor #CBD5E1
    LineThickness 1
    FontColor #334155
    FontStyle bold
  }
  circle {
    BackgroundColor #334155
    LineColor #334155
  }
  note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #CBD5E1
    FontColor #475569
    FontSize 11
  }
  .created {
    BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
    LineColor #34D399
    FontColor #065F46
  }
}
</style>

|#F5F3FF|trader (LP)\nParty|
|#F8FAFC|venueOperator\nParty|
|#EFF6FF|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
|#FFF7ED|CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|

|trader (LP)\nParty|
start
:Exercise **PoolAccess_RequestLiquidityDeposit**\non **PoolAccess**;
|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
:Validate **PoolAccess**, **KycAttestation**\nand signed deposit terms;
|CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|
:Exercise **AllocationFactory_Allocate**\non **AllocationFactory**\n(base + quote + LP receipt);
|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
:Return **DepositRequest** record;
-> separate transaction;
|CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|
if (Allocations pending\nNext action?) then (recover after deadline)
  group Optional recovery\nUnsettled allocations after the deadline {
    |trader (LP)\nParty|
    :Exercise **PoolAccess_RecoverAllocations**\non **PoolAccess**;
    |DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
    :Validate access, KYC, trader,\npool and expired deadline;
    |CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|
    :Exercise **Allocation_Withdraw**\non **Allocation**;
    stop
  }
else (settle before deadline)
endif

|venueOperator\nParty|
:Exercise **VenueDelegation_AddLiquidity**\non **VenueDelegation**;
|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
:Recheck each provider's **PoolAccess**\nand **KycAttestation**;
:Exercise **Pool_AddLiquidity**\non **Pool**\n(dvo + venueOperator);
while (Next deposit in batch?) is (yes)
:Compute initial or proportional deposit\nusing **PoolConfig** + **PoolState**;
:Check **minLpOut**, ratio bounds\nand deadline;
|CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|
:Exercise **AllocationFactory_Allocate**\non **AllocationFactory**\n(pool reserves + LP mint);
:Exercise **SettlementFactory_SettleBatch**\non **SettlementFactory**\n(deposits + refunds + LP mint);

|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
:Create **LiquidityReceipt**; <<created>>
endwhile (no)
:Archive **PoolState**;
:Create **PoolState**\nwith final reserves, holdings and LP supply; <<created>>
stop
@enduml
